{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-25-1","title":"Psalms 25:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David's confidence in prayer. 7 He prays for remission of sins; 16 and for help in affliction.</p>\n<p>A.M. cir. 3463. B.C. cir. 541. do I. 24:4; 86:4; 143:8; 1Sa 1:15; La 3:41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-2","title":"Psalms 25:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>O. 7:1; 18:2; 22:1,5,8; 31:1; 34:8; 37:40; 71:1; Isa 26:3; 28:16; 41:16 Isa 49:23; Ro 5:5; 10:11; 1Pe 2:6 let not. 13:2-4; 35:19-25; 41:11; 56:1; 94:3; 142:6; Isa 36:14-20 Isa 37:10,20,35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-3","title":"Psalms 25:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>wait. 27:14; 33:20; 37:34; 40:1-3; 62:1,5; 123:2; Ge 49:13; Isa 25:9 Isa 40:31; La 3:25; Mic 7:7; Ro 8:25 be ashamed. 69:6 let 6:10; 31:17; 35:26; 40:14,15; 70:2,3; 71:13; 132:18; Jer 20:11 without. 7:4,5; 59:2-5; 69:4; 109:3; 119:78; Joh 15:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-4","title":"Psalms 25:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>5:1,8; 27:11; 86:11; 119:27; 143:8; Ex 33:13; Pr 8:20; Isa 2:3 Jer 6:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-5","title":"Psalms 25:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Lead. 8,10; 43:3,4; 107:7; Isa 35:8; 42:16; 49:10; Jer 31:9; Joh 8:31,32 Joh 14:26; 16:13; Ro 8:14; Eph 4:21; 1Jo 2:27; Re 7:17 teach. 119:26,33,66; Ne 9:20; Job 36:22; Isa 54:13; Jer 31:33,34 Joh 6:45; Eph 4:20,21 God. 24:5; 68:20; 79:9; 88:1 on thee. 22:2; 86:3; 88:1; 119:97; Pr 8:34; 23:17; Isa 30:18; Lu 18:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-6","title":"Psalms 25:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Remember. 98:3; 106:45; 136:23; 2Ch 6:42; Lu 1:54,71,72 thy tender mercies. Heb. bowels. 40:11; 69:13,16; 103:4; 119:77; Isa 55:7; 63:15; Jer 31:20 Lu 1:78; *marg: 2Co 1:3; Php 1:8; 2:1; Col 3:12; 1Jo 3:17 for they. 77:7-12; 103:17; 106:1; 107:1; 136:11-26; Ge 24:27; 32:9; Ex 15:13 Ex 34:6; Ne 9:19; Jer 33:11; Mic 7:18-20; Lu 1:50</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-7","title":"Psalms 25:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Remember. 79:8; 109:14,16; Isa 38:17; 43:25; 64:9; Heb 8:12; 10:16-18 the sins. Job 13:26; 20:11; Pr 5:7-14; Jer 3:25; Joh 5:5,14 according. 51:1; 109:26; 119:124 for thy. 6:4; 31:16; Eph 1:6,7; 2:4-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-8","title":"Psalms 25:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Good. 119:68 upright. 92:15; Isa 26:7 teach. Pr 1:20-23; 2:1-6; 9:4-6; Mic 4:2; Mt 9:13; 11:29,30; Lu 11:13 Joh 6:44,45; 2Co 4:6; Eph 1:17,18; Jas 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-9","title":"Psalms 25:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>meek. 22:26; 76:9; 147:6; 149:4; Isa 11:4; 61:1; Zep 2:3; Mt 5:5; Ga 5:23 Jas 1:21; 1Pe 3:4,15 guide. 23:3; 32:8,9; 73:24; 119:66; 143:10; Pr 3:5,6; 8:20; Isa 42:1-3 Eze 11:19,20; 36:27 his way. 119:35; Joh 14:6; Ac 9:2; 13:10; Heb 10:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-10","title":"Psalms 25:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>the paths. 18:25,26; 28:4-6; 37:23,24; 91:14; 119:75,76; 138:7; Ge 5:24; 17:1 Ge 48:15,16; Isa 43:2; Ro 8:28 mercy. 33:4; 57:3; 85:10; 89:14; 98:3; Ge 24:27; 2Sa 15:20; Isa 25:1 Joh 1:14,17; Jas 5:11 keep. 24:4,5; 50:23; 103:17,18; Isa 56:1-6; Ho 14:9; Zep 2:3; Ac 10:35 Ro 2:13; Heb 8:8-12; 12:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-11","title":"Psalms 25:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>thy. 31:3; 79:9; 109:21; 143:11; Isa 43:25; 48:9; Eze 20:9; 36:22 1Jo 2:12 for it. Nu 14:17-19; Ro 5:15,20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-12","title":"Psalms 25:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>What. 111:10; Pr 1:7; 2:5; 15:33; 16:6; Ec 12:13; Isa 50:10; Ac 10:2,22 Ac 13:26 him. 32:8; 37:23; Isa 35:8; Joh 3:20,21; 7:17; 8:31,32; Ac 11:14 2Th 2:10-12; 1Jo 2:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-13","title":"Psalms 25:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>His soul. De 33:12,26-29; Pr 1:33; 19:23; 29:25; Eze 34:25-28; Mt 11:28,29 dwell at ease. Heb. lodge in goodness. 31:19; 36:8; 63:5; Isa 66:10-14; Jer 31:12-14; Zep 3:17; Zec 9:17 Php 4:19 his seed. 37:26; 69:36; 112:2; Ge 17:7-10; Pr 20:7; Isa 65:23; Jer 32:39 Ac 2:39 inherit. 37:11,22,29; Eze 33:24-26; Mt 5:5; 1Pe 3:10; 2Pe 3:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-14","title":"Psalms 25:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>secret. Ge 18:17-19; Jer 13:18; Pr 3:32; Mt 13:11,12; Joh 7:17 Joh 14:17,21-23; 15:15; 17:6; 1Co 2:14; Eph 1:9,18; Col 3:3 Re 2:17 he will, etc. or, his covenant to make them know it. Ge 17:13; De 4:13; Jer 31:31-34; Ro 11:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-15","title":"Psalms 25:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Mine. 121:1,2; 123:2; 141:8 pluck. Heb. bring forth. out. 31:4; 124:7,8; Jer 5:26; 2Ti 2:25,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-16","title":"Psalms 25:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Turn. 60:1; 69:16; 86:16; Mic 7:19 for I. 69:14-20; 88:15-18; 143:4; Da 9:17; Mr 15:33-35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-17","title":"Psalms 25:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>34:19; 38:1-8; 42:7; 77:2-4; Hab 3:17-19; 1Co 4:11-13; 2Co 4:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-18","title":"Psalms 25:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Look. 119:132,153; 1Sa 1:11; 2Sa 16:12; La 5:1; Lu 1:25 forgive. 32:1-5; 51:8,9; Mt 9:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-19","title":"Psalms 25:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Consider. 3:1,2; 27:2,12; 38:19; 56:2; 57:4; 138:7; 143:3; 2Sa 16:11; 17:2-4 Lu 22:2; 23:5,21-23 cruel hatred. Heb. hatred of violence. 11:5; 18:48; *marg: 52:2; 86:14; 140:1,4,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-20","title":"Psalms 25:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>O. 17:8; 22:20,21; 121:7; Lu 23:46; Ac 7:59 let. 71:1,2; Joe 2:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-21","title":"Psalms 25:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>7:8; 18:20-24; 26:1,11; 41:12; 1Sa 24:11-13; 26:23; Pr 11:3; 20:7 Da 6:22; Ac 24:16; 25:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-25-22","title":"Psalms 25:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":25,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":25,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>14:7; 51:18,19; 122:6; 130:8</p>"}]}